// '->prop' step (PHP's "simple" syntax - anything richer needs the '{$...}' form).
// The index key is an integer, a BARE word (taken as a string: "$map[key]") or
// another variable; it is captured as text and classified by makeTplVar.
TplVar      <~~ push({e: makeTplVar(takeAll())}) ~~>
